      "content": "【“海峽有渡·創意無限” 第十一屆兩岸青年創客工作坊在溫啟動】\n7月6日，以“海峽有渡·創意無限”為主題的第十一屆兩岸青年創客工作坊暨第二屆兩岸教師發展交流會在浙江工貿職業技術學院拉開帷幕。來自海峽兩岸80餘名青年創客、高校教師及行業企業代表齊聚溫州，共同開啟一場融合科技、文化與創新的交流盛宴。\n本屆創客工作坊緊扣AI時代發展需求，聚焦兩大核心方向。一方面，推動非遺、文創與AI深度融合。邀請多家企業圍繞公司IP角色矩陣、智能按摩設備、兒童娛樂設施等企業發展需求“出題”，兩岸高校的年輕創客將通過設計與原型開發“答題”。另一方面，促進兩岸教師共探育人新模式。以“AI融合創新——賦能教學、驅動科研、鏈接產業”為主題，兩岸教師通過交流會，圍繞AI課程開發、科研合作及產教融合路徑展開深度研討，攜手培育適應未來產業需求的創新型人才。\n\n[The 11th Cross-Strait Youth Maker Workshop, Themed \"Boundless Creativity Across the Strait,\" Kicks Off in Wenzhou]\n\nOn July 6, the 11th Cross-Strait Youth Maker Workshop and the 2nd Cross-Strait Teacher Development Exchange Meeting, themed \"Boundless Creativity Across the Strait\" (海峽有渡·創意無限), officially commenced at Zhejiang Industry and Trade Vocational College. Over 80 young makers, university faculty, and industry representatives from both sides of the strait gathered in Wenzhou to embark on a grand exchange integrating technology, culture, and innovation.\n\nClosely aligning with the demands of the AI era, this year's workshop focuses on two core directions.\n\nFirst, it drives the deep integration of intangible cultural heritage, cultural creativity, and AI. Several enterprises were invited to present \"challenges\" based on their development needs—such as IP character matrices, smart massage devices, and children's amusement facilities. Young makers from universities across the strait will provide \"solutions\" through design and prototype development.\n\nSecond, it encourages teachers from both sides to jointly explore new educational models. Under the theme \"AI Integrated Innovation—Empowering Teaching, Driving Research, and Linking Industries,\" educators will hold in-depth discussions on AI curriculum development, research collaboration, and pathways for industry-education integration, joining forces to cultivate innovative talents equipped for future industry needs."
